    "guide": "Call GET https://blockrun.ai/api/v1/surf/market/price with a required ?symbol=<TICKER> query param (e.g. symbol=BTC); omitting it returns a 400 with no charge. The x402 wallet pays automatically (~$0.0075 USDC on Base). The 200 response is a price time series at body.data[], an array of {symbol, metric:'price', value, timestamp} hourly points; take the last element's .value for the latest USD price. Use other tickers (ETH, SOL, etc.) by changing the symbol.",
